From: Galaxy Tab S9 Ultra Ubuntu port <noreply@example.com>
Subject: [PATCH] spa: libcamera: convert the model string view explicitly

libcamera 0.7 exposes string controls and properties as string_view. C++17
does not implicitly convert that view to std::string in a return statement.
---
 spa/plugins/libcamera/libcamera-device.cpp | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/spa/plugins/libcamera/libcamera-device.cpp b/spa/plugins/libcamera/libcamera-device.cpp
index b25a4eb728d8312b789a5d2d72ee462b94f231bc..41483b28efa18e8e7e1276409ff7beca3db71356 100644
--- a/spa/plugins/libcamera/libcamera-device.cpp
+++ b/spa/plugins/libcamera/libcamera-device.cpp
@@ -74,7 +74,7 @@ static std::string cameraModel(const Camera *camera)
 	const ControlList &props = camera->properties();
 
 	if (auto model = props.get(properties::Model))
-		return std::move(model.value());
+		return std::string(model.value());
 
 	return camera->id();
 }
